# Qwiklabs Challenge Lab SQL

When editing or tidying `.sql` challenge-lab write-ups in this repo:

- Keep **every** original word and SQL verbatim (prompts, comments, commented thinking, answers).
- Tidy **whitespace only** (blank lines / EOF newline). No condensed prompts, no AI approach notes, no new prose labels.
- Do not delete commented thinking; uncommented SQL is the answer.
- Keep `qwiklabs-gcp-…` project IDs as-is.
- Prefer course-folder layout: `<Lab Name>/<Lab Name>: Challenge Lab.sql`.
- Leave existing `.md` labs alone unless asked.
- Read `.cursor/skills/tidy-qwiklabs-challenge-sql/SKILL.md` for the full workflow and verification step.
